241:             </section>
242:             <section className="signal-quote rounded-xl p-5"><p className="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-accent">Field note / 01</p><p className="mt-3 font-serif text-xl leading-snug">“A clear signal is worth protecting.”</p><p className="mt-3 font-mono text-[9px] text-subtle">— NETWORK OPS</p></section>
243:           </aside>
244:         </div>
